\ Block numbers outside 1..100, and blocks before block-open
5 block b@ .          \ RMS-F-ISI: block file not open
block-open
0 block b@ .          \ an RMS error, not an unread buffer
0 block b@ .          \ the same error again
101 block b@ .        \ RMS-E-EOF
101 block b@ .        \ RMS-E-EOF again, not an unread buffer
empty-buffers
1 block b@ . 2 block b@ . 3 block b@ . 4 block b@ .   \ 1 2 3 4
block-close
.st
